  "whatThisIs": "The pack a new client receives. It contains the workbooks a client fills or reviews, the column contracts those workbooks map into, the governance files that define types and segmentation, and a worked example showing what a complete package looks like. Nothing outside this folder is an approved starting point.",
  "howAClientUsesIt": [
    "Open AbarVa_Template_Pack_Index_v3.xlsx. It is the front door.",
    "Read Start Here, then Intake Workstreams: ten workstreams, each owned by a group the client already has.",
    "Use Review Queue to assign an owner and a date per workstream.",
    "Send the exports and documents listed. Source Extract Map shows where a ready-made extract template exists.",
    "AbarVa maps the evidence into the 19 canonical files. Canonical Mapping shows where each workstream lands.",
    "SMEs review the result and record decisions in SME Review Matrix.",
    "Evidence and Gates lists what stays closed until that review completes."
  ],
